  "question": "This is an email marketing system for managing user accounts, email campaigns, mailing lists, subscriber relationships, and campaign message status. For user management, the system manages user account information, including name, email address, and account status, supporting account creation, deletion, and status updates. For email campaign management, the system supports creating and managing email campaigns, including campaign subject, content, status, and scheduled sending time. Campaigns can be associated with multiple mailing lists, and the system supports campaign planning, sending, cancellation, and failure status management. For mailing list management, the system supports creating and managing mailing lists, including list name and status, with each list being associated with a user account, supporting list creation, deletion, and status updates. For subscriber management, the system manages subscriber information, including name, email address, and subscription status, with each subscriber being associated with a user account, supporting subscriber creation, deletion, unsubscription, and status updates. For subscription relationship management, the system manages relationships between subscribers and mailing lists, supporting subscription relationship creation and deletion. For message status management, the system records creation time and message status for each subscriber in each email campaign, supporting message pending, sent, cancelled, and failed status management.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0104\nCREATE TABLE `user_account` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `account_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_user_account_email` (`email`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `mailing_list` (\n  `list_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `list_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `list_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`list_id`),\n  KEY `mailing_list_ibfk_1` (`user_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `mailing_list_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user_account` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `subscriber` (\n  `subscriber_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `subscription_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`subscriber_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_subscriber_email` (`email`),\n  KEY `subscriber_ibfk_1` (`user_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `subscriber_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user_account` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `email_campaign` (\n  `campaign_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `subject` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `content` text NOT NULL,\n  `campaign_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `scheduled_send_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`campaign_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `campaign_mailing_list` (\n  `campaign_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `list_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`campaign_id`,`list_id`),\n  KEY `campaign_mailing_list_ibfk_2` (`list_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `campaign_mailing_list_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`campaign_id`) REFERENCES `email_campaign` (`campaign_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `campaign_mailing_list_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`list_id`) REFERENCES `mailing_list` (`list_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `subscription` (\n  `subscriber_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `list_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`subscriber_id`,`list_id`),\n  KEY `subscription_ibfk_2` (`list_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `subscription_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`subscriber_id`) REFERENCES `subscriber` (`subscriber_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `subscription_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`list_id`) REFERENCES `mailing_list` (`list_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `campaign_message_status` (\n  `campaign_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `subscriber_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `created_at` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `message_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`campaign_id`,`subscriber_id`),\n  KEY `campaign_message_status_ibfk_2` (`subscriber_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `campaign_message_status_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`campaign_id`) REFERENCES `email_campaign` (`campaign_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `campaign_message_status_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`subscriber_id`) REFERENCES `subscriber` (`subscriber_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
